    .type-body           body          text.body           Paragraph text
    .type-caption        small         text.body           Captions

    Color theory for role-based aliases system-level coherence
    Near-white (brand-50)     → maximum importance: section headings, card titles
    Warm cream (brand-400)    → hero character: hero headline only
    Cool near-white (sec-300) → secondary importance: subheadlines, prices
    Medium gray (sec-400)     → tertiary: body, metadata, captions
    Gold (accent-500)         → accent signal: overlines only

